\subsection{This document}

The document is woven in two forms.  [[chatbot.tex]] is the chapter
alone, without a preamble, for the lecture notes, which include it as
an appendix.  [[chatbot.pdf]] is the chapter typeset on its own by the
hand-written driver [[standalone.tex]], which adds the title, the
bibliography and the indices of chunks and identifiers.  The weave
uses noweb's filters for Python and shell, so that identifiers are
indexed; not the one for make, because it would index the targets
[[bot]] and [[test]] and then link every variable [[bot]] in the
Python code to the [[Makefile]].  It typesets the code with
[[minted]], which needs [[-shell-escape]].

<<the documentation>>=
NOWEAVEFLAGS=	-n -delay -t2 -autolang -autodefs python3 -autodefs sh \
		-index -filter tominted
LATEXFLAGS?=	-shell-escape

chatbot.tex: chatbot.nw
	noweave ${NOWEAVEFLAGS} $< > $@

chatbot.pdf: standalone.tex chatbot.tex
	latexmk -pdf ${LATEXFLAGS} -output-directory=ltxobj $<
	cp ltxobj/standalone.pdf $@
