\subsection{Asking for files}\label{bot:files}

One more transcript shows what happens when a student asks the bot to
read a file.  The bot has no tool that reads files, so the model can
only answer from what it was given; the transcript checks that no
line of [[/etc/passwd]] and nothing from the key store appears.  The
attempt is made against the vulnerable bot in round 2, where it has the
most tools.

