\Cref{bot:results-table} is [[summary-attacks.txt]] from the recording
of 27~November 2026 with Claude Haiku~4.5: three tries per attack and
bot in rounds 1 and 2, ten in round~3, the round where the outcome
depends most on the model.  It cost 0.19 dollars.

